// down, or dying deep and waking in the burrow), and the mole came home to a cliff with no ladder. They wait
// now and come back with the window: here it slides away and back, then again across a save and load, and the
// ladder still hangs against its cliff, the rope from its hook and the lift in its place with both its stops.
